msgid "Driver-card image downloaded through the vehicle unit: the two leading bytes are the transfer header (SID + TREP 06) kept by the tool that saved it, not the standard storage form of a card file (DDP_050). Some other programs report such a file as corrupt; the card data are complete and its signatures are verified normally."
msgstr "Slika vozniške kartice, prenesena prek enote vozila: prva dva bajta sta glava prenosa (SID + TREP 06), ki jo je ohranil program, ki je datoteko shranil, in ne standardna oblika shranjevanja datoteke kartice (DDP_050). Nekateri drugi programi takšno datoteko prijavijo kot poškodovano; podatki kartice so popolni in njihovi podpisi se preverjajo običajno."

